{
  "_comment": [
    "recburn / rec-subtitle vocabulary — the proper nouns Whisper keeps guessing phonetically.",
    "Used TWICE: 'terms' become whisper --initial_prompt (bias), and 'corrections' sweep the",
    "finished .srt (repair). Bias alone is not reliable; the sweep is what makes it certain.",
    "Edit this file (or ~/.config/recburn/vocabulary.json, or ./.recburn-vocabulary.json) —",
    "no rebuild needed. Aliases are matched SPACE-INSENSITIVELY, so 'pocketti' also catches",
    "'pocket ti' and 'pock-etti' — list the letters, never the spacings. 'fuzzy' catches",
    "UNLISTED mishearings that sound the same (Soundex): single nonsense words, and also",
    "multi-word spans that Whisper CAPITALISED mid-sentence, which is how it flags something",
    "it thinks is a name — that is what catches 'Pocket to' without touching 'pocket to'."
